===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|manly}}, {{m|enm|manli}}, {{m|enm|manlich}}, from {{inh|en|ang|*manlīċ}}, {{m|ang|*mannlīċ}} (suggested by adverb {{m|ang|manlīċe}}, {{m|ang|mannlīċe|t=in a manly way; stately}}), from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*mannlīkaz|t=manly}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|man|ly|id2=adjectival}}. Cognate with {{cog|goh|manlīh|t=manly}} ({{cog|de|männlich}}), {{cog|nl|mannelijk}}, {{cog|non|mannligr|t=human}} ({{cog|da|mandlig}}, {{cog|sv|manlig}}).

